From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:31:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mb/lenovo/haswell: Return nothing from the dGPU power
 resource's _OFF

A power resource's _OFF returns nothing (ACPI 7.2.3). The _OFF of the
W541's PGPR returns Zero, at the end and when the dGPU is already off;
fwts flags it as MethodShouldReturnNothing (MEDIUM) on a W541 with
the dGPU off.

Do the power-down inside If (DGPS ()) with no Return.

TEST=ThinkPad W541 with the NVIDIA GPU off: fwts method on the DSDT
of v1.6.0-rc7 reports MethodShouldReturnNothing for
\_SB.PCI0.PEGP.PGPR._OFF, an Integer 0 returned.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I5a9f7fb5a532c88f5a3ccefd0e7c698ca9fea88b
---
 src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/dgpu.asl | 28 ++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/dgpu.asl b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/dgpu.asl
index 90120499be..5a9380fd7b 100644
--- a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/dgpu.asl
+++ b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/acpi/dgpu.asl
@@ -186,26 +186,24 @@ Scope (\_SB.PCI0.PEGP)
 			\_SB.PCI0.PEGP.DEV0.RSID ()
 		}
 
+		/* _OFF returns nothing (ACPI 7.2.3): nothing to do when already off */
 		Method (_OFF, 0, Serialized)
 		{
-			If (!DGPS ()) {
-				Return (Zero)
-			}
+			If (DGPS ()) {
+				/* Take the link down before removing power */
+				LNKD = 1
+				Local0 = 100
+				While (LNKS && Local0) {
+					Sleep (1)
+					Local0--
+				}
 
-			/* Take the link down before removing power */
-			LNKD = 1
-			Local0 = 100
-			While (LNKS && Local0) {
+				DGSB (DGPU_RST_N_BIT, 0)
 				Sleep (1)
-				Local0--
+				DGSB (DGPU_PWR_BIT, 0)
+				/* Let the rails discharge before a subsequent _ON */
+				Sleep (100)
 			}
-
-			DGSB (DGPU_RST_N_BIT, 0)
-			Sleep (1)
-			DGSB (DGPU_PWR_BIT, 0)
-			/* Let the rails discharge before a subsequent _ON */
-			Sleep (100)
-			Return (Zero)
 		}
 	}
 
